{c: Verse 1}
[G] Itni mohabbat karta hoon,        Ke lafz [Em] bhi na keh paaye
Tum mile mujhe yun [C] lage,        Jaise koi duaa [D] mill jaaye
Mujhe [Em] jeena tera bana [Bm] le,        Kiya [Em] khud ko tere hawaale [Bm]
Sochun [Em] tujhe shaam se subah [Bm] tak,        [B] Har lamha
Ki [Em] shab [D] tum [C] ho [G] ... [D],        Tumhi [Em] din [D] ho [C] [G] .. [D]
Ik [Em] dil hi toh tha [G] mera,        Woh bhi tune [D] le liya [Em]
Mujhe [Em] dena tu wafaa [G],        Yeh hi tujhse [D] ilteja [Em]
[Am] Shabnami si ho tum [Bm],        Meri [C] pyaas mein rehna [Em]
Mera [Am] sukoon ho tum [Bm],        Mere [C] paas hi rehna [Em]
[Em] Mujhe jeena tera bana [Bm] le,        Kiya [Em] khud ko tere hawaale [Bm]
Sochun [Em] tujhe shaam se subah [Bm] tak,        Har [B] lamha?
